{"text": "Jemima Puddle duck was a farm duck, and she was very annoyed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The farmers wife would not let her hatch her own eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her sister in law, Rebeccah, was happy to leave the hatching to others. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I do not have the patience to sit on a nest for twenty eight days, Rebeccah said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Neither do you, Jemima, and you would let them go cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I want to hatch my own eggs, all by myself, said Jemima. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She tried to hide her eggs, but someone always found them and carried them off. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So she decided to make a nest far away from the farm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One fine spring afternoon, she set off along the road over the hill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was wearing a shawl and a bonnet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She ran down the hill, flapping her shawl, and then she flew into the air.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "P", "u", "d", "d", "l", "e", " ", "d", "u", "c", "k", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "f", "a", "r", "m", " ", "d", "u", "c", "k", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "a", "n", "n", "o", "y", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "f", "a", "r", "m", "e", "r", "s", " ", "w", "i", "f", "e", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "l", "e", "t", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "a", "t", "c", "h", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "e", "g", "g", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", "r", " ", "s", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "i", "n", " ", "l", "a", "w", ",", " ", "R", "e", "b", "e", "c", "c", "a", "h", ",", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "h", "a", "p", "p", "y", " ", "t", "o", " ", 